      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;IKVM.NET is an implementation of a Java VM on top of Microsoft .NET and Mono. In this talk I&amp;#39;ll describe how Java 7&amp;#39;s JSR 292 invokedynamic and MethodHandles have been implemented in IKVM.NET.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
